{
  "slug": "kicad-happy",
  "name": "Kicad Happy",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "KiCad electronics design skills. Analyze schematics, review PCB layouts, download datasheets, source components, and prep boards for fabrication.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `bom` (BOM (Bill of Materials) management for electronics projects — the workflow skill that coordinates DigiKey, Mouser, LCSC, element14,…), `datasheets` (Extract structured specifications from electronic component datasheet PDFs — pinouts, electrical characteristics, peripherals, topology, and features), `digikey` (Search DigiKey for electronic components and download datasheets — primary source for prototype orders and the preferred API…), `element14` (Search Newark, Farnell, and element14 for electronic components — find parts by MPN or distributor part number, check…), `emc` (EMC pre-compliance risk analysis for KiCad PCB designs — 18 check categories, 44 rule IDs covering ground planes,…), `jlcpcb` (JLCPCB PCB fabrication and assembly — BOM/CPL generation, basic vs extended parts, assembly constraints, design rules, ordering workflow), `kicad` (Analyze KiCad projects and PDF schematics: schematics, PCB layouts, Gerbers, footprints, symbols, netlists, and design rules), `lcsc` (Search LCSC Electronics for electronic components — find parts by LCSC number (Cxxxxx) or MPN, check stock/pricing, download…), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install kicad-happy@claude-community` from `aklofas/kicad-happy`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
